00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:51.134
My name is Ino Sakura and I'm 15 years old.

00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:53.470
Starting this spring, in order to realize
my dream of becoming an idol,

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:55.681
