00:00:55.681 --> 00:00:57.724
Tokyo, the capital of Japan.

00:00:57.724 --> 00:01:00.185
Entertainment, music, fashion...

00:01:00.185 --> 00:01:02.479
It's the origin of all sorts of trends!

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:04.523
The city of dreams...

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:11.864
I'm here for my first time ever!

00:01:11.864 --> 00:01:13.323
Hey!

00:01:13.323 --> 00:01:14.408
