00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:19.621
All right, it's this way.

00:01:19.621 --> 00:01:20.873
Let's go.

00:01:22.374 --> 00:01:24.376
Y-Yes!

00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:25.586
I'm here.

00:01:25.586 --> 00:01:27.588
In Tokyo, my dream city.

00:01:32.009 --> 00:01:32.968
Huh?

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:36.722
Higashi-Koganei, Higashi-Koganei...

00:01:36.722 --> 00:01:38.682
In the nook of the entertainment industry

00:01:38.682 --> 00:01:42.936
stands the fourth dormitory of
Rat Production, a mid-level agency.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:46.190
The dormitory, known as Mouse House,

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:49.818
is where the girls compete
against each other and grow

00:01:49.818 --> 00:01:54.156
in order to survive the cruel
battlefield of the industry.

