00:04:02.284 --> 00:04:03.577
Y-Yes!

00:04:03.577 --> 00:04:06.496
I've been living in the countryside of Okayama.

00:04:06.496 --> 00:04:09.166
So I was surrounded by farms and paddy fields.

00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:12.544
There would be unattended
roadside shops for veggies...

00:04:13.504 --> 00:04:15.839
Am I really in Tokyo?

00:04:15.839 --> 00:04:17.174
This is Tokyo.

00:04:17.174 --> 00:04:19.176
"Metropolitan Koganei Park"

00:04:19.468 --> 00:04:21.178
All right, we're here.

00:04:21.178 --> 00:04:23.972
This is the fourth dormitory of Rat Productions,
known as Mouse House.

00:04:23.972 --> 00:04:25.140
Wow!

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:26.808
Surprisingly average-looking!

00:04:26.808 --> 00:04:29.561
