00:04:45.786 --> 00:04:47.162
Nice to meet you!

00:04:47.162 --> 00:04:48.372
Hmph.

00:04:48.372 --> 00:04:52.960
I'm Ino Sakura, an aspiring idol from Okayama!

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:57.130
I've still got lots to learn,
so please bear with me!

00:04:58.507 --> 00:05:00.634
I'm Hayu Nukui.

00:05:00.634 --> 00:05:03.011
I'm not known yet, but I'm a musician.

00:05:03.011 --> 00:05:06.390
I-I'm Nina Maehara.

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:08.934
