00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:16.024
Mouse Task Force! Mouse Rangers!

00:05:16.024 --> 00:05:17.276
What?

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:25.450
So what'd you think of our dormitory song?

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:26.743
We all worked on it together!

00:05:26.743 --> 00:05:29.204
I-It was a wonderful song...

00:05:29.204 --> 00:05:30.205
Truly?

00:05:30.205 --> 00:05:31.456
But more importantly!

00:05:31.456 --> 00:05:32.624
More importantly?!

00:05:32.624 --> 00:05:34.501
Are you Broko by any chance?

00:05:34.501 --> 00:05:36.545
You are, right?

00:05:36.545 --> 00:05:38.964
I've always been a fan of yours!

00:05:38.964 --> 00:05:41.758
I love that song in the commercial.

00:05:44.761 --> 00:05:46.346
Wait, huh?

00:05:46.346 --> 00:05:50.601
Ah... ah...! Broko... Broko...

00:05:50.601 --> 00:05:52.728
What's the matter, Broko?

00:05:52.728 --> 00:05:54.646
P-Please, that's enough!

00:05:54.646 --> 00:05:58.150
That's an old scar of Roko's. It's a trauma!

00:05:58.150 --> 00:05:59.902
"Confectionery Builddulce"
"Home of Koganei Puffs"

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:02.446
